{"ticker":"NXPI","updated":"2026-11-27T23:13:00Z","profile":{"longName":"NXP Semiconductors N.V.","shortName":"NXP Semiconductors N.V.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"Netherlands","website":"https://www.nxp.com","fullTimeEmployees":32169,"marketCap":63817297920,"trailingPE":19.920536,"forwardPE":13.793309,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.6251125,"pegRatio":1.15,"targetMeanPrice":302.2069,"targetHighPrice":400.0,"targetLowPrice":175.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":29,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.193,"earningsGrowth":0.403,"grossMargins":0.56457,"operatingMargins":0.33845,"profitMargins":0.23395,"totalRevenue":13797999616,"beta":1.858,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":339.95,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":184.68,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.67},"summary":"NXP Semiconductors N.V. provides semiconductor products in the United States, Germany, Japan, South Korea, Taiwan, Singapore, the Netherlands, Mainland China, Hong Kong, and internationally. The company's product portfolio includes microcontrollers; application processors; communication processors; wireless connectivity solutions, such as near field communications, ultra-wideband, Bluetooth low-energy, Zigbee, Thread, and Wi-Fi and Wi-Fi/Bluetooth integrated SoCs; analog and interface products; radio frequency devices, and security controllers, as well as semiconductor-based environmental and inertial sensors, including pressure, inertial, magnetic, and gyroscopic sensors. Its products are used in various applications, including automotive, industrial and Internet of Things, mobile, and communication infrastructure. The company markets its products to direct sales offices and independent distributors. NXP Semiconductors N.V. has a strategic partnership with Volkswagen AG to advance automotive semiconductor technology. The company was incorporated in 2006 and is headquartered in Eindhoven, the Netherlands.","summary_zh":"NXP Semiconductors N.V. 在美國、德國、日本、韓國、台灣、新加坡、荷蘭、中國大陸、香港和國際上提供半導體產品。該公司的產品組合包括微控制器；應用處理器；通訊處理器；無線連接解決方案，例如近場通訊、超寬頻、低功耗藍牙、Zigbee、Thread、Wi-Fi 和 Wi-Fi/藍牙整合 SoC；類比和介面產品；射頻設備和安全控制器，以及基於半導體感測器的環境和慣性感測器，包括壓力、慣性感測器、磁力和壓性感測器。其產品用於各種應用，包括汽車、工業和物聯網、行動和通訊基礎設施。該公司向直銷辦事處和獨立經銷商銷售其產品。 NXP Semiconductors N.V. 與大眾汽車公司建立策略夥伴關係，共同推進汽車半導體技術。該公司成立於2006年，總部位於荷蘭埃因霍溫。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":227.87,"h":227.96,"l":224.63,"c":226.11,"v":1352200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":225.56,"h":227.95,"l":222.88,"c":227.73,"v":1723300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":225.85,"h":227.85,"l":221.0,"c":224.91,"v":2079800},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":226.0,"h":230.86,"l":225.01,"c":227.71,"v":1831500},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":228.4,"h":232.07,"l":227.99,"c":228.89,"v":1537400},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":232.06,"h":234.0,"l":227.1,"c":231.42,"v":1949600},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":232.55,"h":232.99,"l":219.16,"c":219.58,"v":2492900},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":219.89,"h":227.19,"l":219.5,"c":225.64,"v":2631200},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":223.31,"h":225.76,"l":218.98,"c":221.42,"v":2615600},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":221.07,"h":222.67,"l":205.14,"c":205.37,"v":3980800},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":211.61,"h":217.4,"l":210.74,"c":216.7,"v":2806300},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":211.68,"h":219.69,"l":210.8,"c":216.11,"v":2341700},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":219.76,"h":220.0,"l":214.02,"c":217.23,"v":1939300},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":219.37,"h":220.17,"l":213.11,"c":217.41,"v":2477700},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":216.72,"h":218.05,"l":212.88,"c":214.35,"v":1950400},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":216.72,"h":222.23,"l":215.6,"c":219.82,"v":2374500},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":219.34,"h":224.27,"l":218.51,"c":222.34,"v":1935400},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":217.07,"h":223.28,"l":215.0,"c":217.16,"v":3607800},{"t":"2025-10-23","o":213.0,"h":221.4,"l":212.73,"c":220.73,"v":2517700},{"t":"2025-10-24","o":223.96,"h":223.96,"l":218.12,"c":219.16,"v":2500800},{"t":"2025-10-27","o":221.39,"h":221.89,"l":218.89,"c":221.56,"v":4076100},{"t":"2025-10-28","o":218.16,"h":220.43,"l":207.99,"c":212.96,"v":4414700},{"t":"2025-